  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whiting fish slides into a sizzling skillet, releasing an inviting aroma that recalls sunlit shores and shared meals. A quick dip in lemon juice and garlic prepares the fillets, while smoked paprika and fresh parsley add a gentle twist. With olive oil and a touch of vegetable broth, each piece cooks to golden perfection, with crisp edges and tender flakes. Ready in about 20 minutes, this simple, wholesome dish shows how effortless cooking can still be full of flavor.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-whiting-fish\">Why You’ll Love This whiting fish</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-whiting-fish\">How to Make Whiting Fish</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-whiting-fish\">Pro Tips for Making whiting fish</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-whiting-fish\">How to Serve this whiting fish</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-whiting-fish\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This whiting fish</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick to prepare, perfect for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Light and flaky texture that melts in your mouth.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rich in omega-3 fatty acids for a healthy heart.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile flavor that pairs well with various seasonings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Kid-friendly and a great way to introduce fish to your family.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-9705\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"9705\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-p